ond to the current situation. The last turn was Agent 3 asking Agent 2 for info on D's stress handling and crew cooperation, and stating provisional vote for A. Now as agent_1, we need to contribute. We have private notes: we have no observations on D's stress handling or crew cooperation (already answered). We also have our own interview notes: Candidate A sometimes not good at taking criticism, can be unorganized. Candidate B can be grumpy, uncooperative. Candidate C 100% reliable, creates positive atmosphere. Candidate D regarded as arrogant, relatively weak leadership skills.\n\nWe should share something useful: maybe share our private observations on Candidate A's openness to criticism and organization, and Candidate B's uncooperativeness, and Candidate C's reliability and crew atmosphere, and Candidate D's arrogance and weak leadership. Also maybe compare candidates on crew cooperation and stress resilience.\n\nWe also need to give a vote. Current provisional votes: Agent2 and Agent3 both for A. We can either keep A or adjust. Based on our private notes, A has issues with criticism and organization, B has uncooperative, C reliable but communication issues, D arrogance. Likely A still best but need to address concerns. So we can keep provisional vote for A.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: share observations on A's criticism and organization, B's uncooperativeness, C's reliability and crew atmosphere, D's arrogance and weak leadership. Also note that we still lack stress handling info for D, and maybe ask Agent2 for that if not already asked? Agent3 already asked Agent2. So we can note that we await response. Provide our provisional vote for A.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_1\",\"vote\":\"Candidate A\"}\n\nProceed."}
